{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2023-01-25 13:58:00', 'title': "JACOBS' BOARD APPROVES $1 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION AND INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND RATE BY 13%", 'text': 'DALLAS , JAN. 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE JACOBS\' (NYSE:J) BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A NEW INCREMENTAL SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION (THE "2023 SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM"). THE 2023 SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM AUTHORIZES THE PURCHASE OF UP TO $1 BILLION OF JACOBS\' COMMON STOCK.'}